{
  "source": "Prompts/what-is-ai-3.mp4",
  "duration": 157.547375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.54,
      "end": 7.72,
      "text": "Ask your desk. Give me 10 ideas for my next history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.42,
      "end": 11.14,
      "text": "Pause. Nothing. It's a desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.9,
      "end": 13.56,
      "text": "Ask a friend and they can help you brainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 17.26,
      "text": "Ask AI and it can give you a list in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.92,
      "end": 20.96,
      "text": "You ask AI. Give me 10 ideas for my history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.32,
      "end": 27.12,
      "text": "It gives you 10 history project ideas like ancient Egypt, the printing press, the Silk Road,"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.12,
      "end": 32.02,
      "text": "the moon landing, the Roman Empire, the Industrial Revolution, the civil rights movement,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.46,
      "end": 36.0,
      "text": "the history of voting, the invention of flight, and the Berlin Wall."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.74,
      "end": 40.22,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things that used to take a human brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.78,
      "end": 44.9,
      "text": "It can understand a question, summarize information, and translate a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 47.6,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it thinks like your friend."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.92,
      "end": 50.32,
      "text": "And it doesn't mean all 10 of those ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.62,
      "end": 54.52,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with tasks that once needed a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.52,
      "end": 57.06,
      "text": "Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.6,
      "end": 59.62,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.34,
      "end": 62.42,
      "text": "This board shows two common types of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.98,
      "end": 64.74,
      "text": "On the left is recommendation AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.28,
      "end": 67.56,
      "text": "Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.26,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options and selecting the likely best match."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.8,
      "end": 77.3,
      "text": "Everyday examples include your next Netflix show, Spotify song, or maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.02,
      "end": 79.7,
      "text": "On the right is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.08,
      "end": 82.18,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.18,
      "end": 85.52,
      "text": "It uses learned patterns to create a new output."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.22,
      "end": 90.3,
      "text": "It builds this output from your prompt, the specific question or instructions you give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.78,
      "end": 95.78,
      "text": "Everyday examples include an email, essay, image, website, song, or video."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.58,
      "end": 97.34,
      "text": "AI can recommend."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.04,
      "end": 98.84,
      "text": "AI can create."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.6,
      "end": 101.58,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.26,
      "end": 103.86,
      "text": "Here is what that difference looks like."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.22,
      "end": 106.16,
      "text": "The scenario? You're in the mood for superheroes."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.02,
      "end": 110.6,
      "text": "This board compares how both types of AI handle that exact same scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.6,
      "end": 114.84,
      "text": "Recommendation AI handles the job of finding a superhero movie you might enjoy."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.48,
      "end": 121.08,
      "text": "You get Captain America Civil War, a movie selected from an existing catalog based on your interests."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.78,
      "end": 123.8,
      "text": "It picked a movie that already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.46,
      "end": 130.26,
      "text": "Generative AI takes your request and writes a scene about two superhero teammates who disagree."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.8,
      "end": 132.52,
      "text": "What you get is an original script."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.5,
      "end": 135.38,
      "text": "We save the bridge, Maya said."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.96,
      "end": 139.12,
      "text": "The hospital loses power in three minutes, Leo replied."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.12,
      "end": 140.24,
      "text": "We can't do both."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.06,
      "end": 143.0,
      "text": "It generated a scene from your request."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.96,
      "end": 145.24,
      "text": "One helps you find something to watch."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.58,
      "end": 148.0,
      "text": "The other helps you create a story of your own."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.7,
      "end": 151.0,
      "text": "Two kinds. One picks. One creates."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.74,
      "end": 153.78,
      "text": "This course is about the one that creates."
    }
  ],
